Also another sad story. I started a game as healer and after 3 levels my only
problem was being low on intelligence. So I decided to reverse genocide some
mind flayers, thinking my AoLS would help me if necessary.
Well it didn't. My Amulet crumbled to dust, some hitpoints were restored but
Unfortunately my brain was still gone!

Why doesn't a AoLS restore a stat to max if that's the reason for dying?
It works in a lot of cases that way, e.g. starvation, choking or turning 
to stone. It simply fixes the main problem.
I really think this should be changed.

